<title>UK: OPP Petroquimica prices $100 million 8-year bond.</title>
<headline>OPP Petroquimica prices $100 million 8-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond announced earlier by lead manager CS First Boston has now been priced.</p>
<p> BORROWER   OPP PETROQUIMICA</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	COUPON     11.0 PCT  MATURITY   *29.OCT.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.899    PAY DATE    29.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.25 PCT  REOFFER    99.899    SPREAD    +460 BP</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX   DENOMS (K) ONE (REG S) SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP/BR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25 PCT  SELL CONC  1.0 PCT</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND FIVE-YEAR U.S. TREASURY</p>
<p> NOTES	*PUT AND CALL OPTIONS ON 29.OCT.01 AT 99.25</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
